# Crystal run: struve_1321 -> cargo_lanes. Overrides data/scripts/idle_mine.smolt.
#
# TARGET: energy_crystal for the drone refit. wanderers_veil is the RICHEST share
# we know of — 21 of a 63-point mix = ~33% of yields, vs ~24% at ivorygate — but
# its standing pool is only 444 against ivorygate's 5,000. This squad exists to
# spread the draw so one field is not taken to the floor; deposits regenerate, so
# round-trip time matters more than pool size.
#
# autopilot, NOT jump. `jump` is SINGLE-HOP and fails with "X is not connected to
# Y" for anything not adjacent; these agents start 2-16 jumps out. The first
# version of this script used jump and failed on 2026-08-26 — and since an idle
# script is best-effort, the failure did NOT stop the pass: the loop then ran 100
# `mine` attempts against "Nothing to mine here" at the origin, every pass.
# Autopilot routes multi-hop, tops up at the ORIGIN station, and takes the target
# POI as its second argument.
#
# wanderers_veil is a NEBULA; the shared idle_mine travels to $ASTEROID_BELT$ and
# would mine the wrong rock. Yield is RANDOM from the site mix.
#
# struve_1321 has NO STATION. Home is cargo_lanes (6 jumps), desk MEASURED (2
# cr/unit, ~49,970 reserve). NOT zaniah/mera_sanctum, which is 5 jumps and
# measured but is our worst kill zone (6 combat deaths) and these agents hold no
# pirate unlock. The extra jump is the cheap option.
#
# refuel FIRST: tops up before each trip AND recovers a bot run to empty.
# get_system before $STATION$: the POI cache still holds the previous system.
refuel
undock
autopilot struve_1321 wanderers_veil
loop -f 100 mine
autopilot cargo_lanes
get_system
travel $STATION$
dock
deposit_all
